   "text": "net.daringfireball.markdown",
   "component": "infobox",
   "note": "main infobox (filename ext, media type, developer, releases)"
  },
  {
   "text": "is a lightweight markup language for creating formatted text using a plain-text",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "lead paragraph 1 (before first subheading)"
  },
  {
   "text": "contained ambiguities and raised unanswered questions",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "lead paragraph 2"
  },
  {
   "text": "Markdown was inspired by pre-existing conventions for marking up plain text in",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "History"
  },
  {
   "text": "which converts marked-up text input to valid, well-formed XHTML or HTML",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "History, last para"
  },
  {
   "text": "As Markdown's popularity grew rapidly, many Markdown implementations appeared",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "Rise and divergence"
  },
  {
   "text": "text/markdown; variant=CommonMark",
   "component": "infobox",
   "note": "second infobox for CommonMark"
  },
  {
   "text": "launched what Atwood characterised as a standardization effort",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "CommonMark > Standardization"
  },
  {
   "text": "objected to the usage of",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "CommonMark > Name"
  },
  {
   "text": "several websites and projects have adopted CommonMark",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "CommonMark > Adoption"
  },
  {
   "text": "Introduces MIME type",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "bullet list of RFCs inside Adoption"
  },
  {
   "text": "use variants of Markdown to make discussions between users easier",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "Variants"
  },
  {
   "text": "GitHub had been using its own variant of Markdown since as early as 2009",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "Variants > GitHub Flavored Markdown"
  },
  {
   "text": "It adds the following features that are not available with regular Markdown",
   "component": "encyclopedia_section",
   "note": "Variants > Markdown Extra"
  },
  {
